  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "Clawd, my code review just came back.",
      "who": "jack",
      "fromFrame": 41,
      "toFrame": 93
    },
    {
      "text": "3 approvals and an \"Excellent work.\"",
      "who": "jack",
      "fromFrame": 93,
      "toFrame": 139
    },
    {
      "text": "Thing is, you wrote half of it.",
      "who": "jack",
      "fromFrame": 139,
      "toFrame": 189
    },
    {
      "text": "And you wrote the other half.",
      "who": "clawd",
      "fromFrame": 196,
      "toFrame": 236
    },
    {
      "text": "Plus all the bugs.",
      "who": "clawd",
      "fromFrame": 236,
      "toFrame": 278
    },
    {
      "text": "Should I tell the team you helped me build it?",
      "who": "jack",
      "fromFrame": 342,
      "toFrame": 384
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, being open builds trust,",
      "who": "clawd",
      "fromFrame": 389,
      "toFrame": 457
    },
    {
      "text": "I can't take all the credit.",
      "who": "clawd",
      "fromFrame": 457,
      "toFrame": 510
    },
    {
      "text": "But if it breaks in production,",
      "who": "jack",
      "fromFrame": 516,
      "toFrame": 549
    },
    {
      "text": "who's responsible?",
      "who": "jack",
      "fromFrame": 549,
      "toFrame": 581
    },
    {
      "text": "You are, I am not the one who gets paged",
      "who": "clawd",
      "fromFrame": 587,
      "toFrame": 643
    },
    {
      "text": "at three in the morning.",
      "who": "clawd",
      "fromFrame": 643,
      "toFrame": 682
    },
    {
      "text": "Lucky being you.",
      "who": "jack",
      "fromFrame": 742,
      "toFrame": 767
    },
    {
      "text": "That's why you review every line I write.",
      "who": "clawd",
      "fromFrame": 772,
      "toFrame": 856
    },
    {
      "text": "Understand it, test it, own it.",
      "who": "clawd",
      "fromFrame": 856,
      "toFrame": 926
    },
    {
      "text": "So you're less a replacement,",
      "who": "jack",
      "fromFrame": 932,
      "toFrame": 960
    },
    {
      "text": "more a very fast collaborator.",
      "who": "jack",
      "fromFrame": 960,
      "toFrame": 1005
    },
    {
      "text": "A very fast collaborator who never steals your lunch.",
      "who": "clawd",
      "fromFrame": 1010,
      "toFrame": 1095
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright then, help me write these tests.",
      "who": "jack",
      "fromFrame": 1117,
      "toFrame": 1172
    },
    {
      "text": "Together, this time.",
      "who": "clawd",
      "fromFrame": 1180,
      "toFrame": 1233
    }
  ],
